\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overall Item-Macro performance across cold and warm target courses under the strict course-cold split. Values are three-seed means reconstructed per seed by weighting cold and hot course-macro metrics by their evaluated target-course counts. Bold and underlined values denote the best and second-best available means. Each method uses its native ranking score under the common splits and evaluator. PCGNN is marked ``--'' because retained main-table artifacts contain no same-protocol warm-target metrics. Imp.: CKG-RL relative change against the strongest available baseline; this descriptive overall table does not add significance markers.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
